WEBVTT

00:00:01.979 --> 00:00:05.779
Hajimari no kaze yo

00:00:06.216 --> 00:00:10.050
Todoke Message

00:00:10.454 --> 00:00:19.385
'Itsudemo anata wo Shinjiteirukara'

00:00:20.164 --> 00:00:20.664
The Story of Saiunkoku

00:00:20.664 --> 00:00:28.706
The Story of Saiunkoku
Ano toki yume ni miteita
Sekai ni tatteirunoni

00:00:28.706 --> 00:00:29.035
The Story of Saiunkoku

00:00:29.239 --> 00:00:36.441
Miwatasu keshiki ni
Ashi wo sukoshi sukumase

00:00:36.814 --> 00:00:40.944
Dakedo ushiro furimukanaide

00:00:41.051 --> 00:00:45.044
Aruiteyuku koto
Kimeta kara

00:00:45.355 --> 00:00:49.451
Miageta sora
Nana iro no niji

00:00:49.626 --> 00:00:53.027
Anata mo mitemasuka?

00:00:53.363 --> 00:00:57.356
Hajimari no kaze yo

00:00:57.668 --> 00:01:01.434
Todoke Message

00:01:01.839 --> 00:01:10.008
Yumeni kakedashita senaka
Mimamoru kara

00:01:10.447 --> 00:01:14.383
Maiagaru kaze yo

00:01:14.785 --> 00:01:18.585
Hi no hikari matoi

00:01:19.056 --> 00:01:28.488
Jiyuu no tsubasa de
Tsuyoku tobitatou

00:01:32.736 --> 00:01:34.704
The destined day has arrived.

00:01:35.038 --> 00:01:37.506
This night of the new moon,
a night of darkness.

00:01:38.008 --> 00:01:39.771
Tonight the selection
ceremony for the...

00:01:39.843 --> 00:01:41.435
...head of the Sa Clan
will take place.

00:01:43.313 --> 00:01:47.272
In attempts to resolve the
strife surrounding the Sa Clan...

00:01:47.351 --> 00:01:51.378
...Shurei and Shunki set foot inside
the clan's courtyard shrine.

00:01:57.094 --> 00:01:58.356
Kokujun!

00:02:00.397 --> 00:02:05.357
Fight Poison with Poison

00:02:20.384 --> 00:02:24.650
It was fun, but it will all end soon.

00:02:29.259 --> 00:02:31.591
Governor Eigetsu To
of Sa Province...

00:02:32.629 --> 00:02:35.496
...and Lieutenant Governor
Ensei Ro, have arrived.

00:02:45.442 --> 00:02:46.466
Kokujun...!

00:02:57.087 --> 00:02:58.486
Kokujun!

00:03:00.591 --> 00:03:02.559
What I need to do here...

00:03:02.626 --> 00:03:05.094
...is see everything with my own eyes
as the governor and judge him.

00:03:06.563 --> 00:03:08.997
Kokujun. Kokujun!

00:03:10.200 --> 00:03:12.168
Kokujun!

00:03:13.503 --> 00:03:15.471
Snap out of it!

00:03:20.811 --> 00:03:22.779
Kokujun.

00:03:24.648 --> 00:03:26.548
Shun... ki?

00:03:35.826 --> 00:03:39.057
I've... killed my father.

00:03:40.831 --> 00:03:43.197
I stabbed... Grandfather Chusho.

00:03:46.803 --> 00:03:50.796
There's... there's nothing
left for me anymore.

00:03:52.509 --> 00:03:54.977
Not even the one thing
that was my own, my heart.

00:04:06.290 --> 00:04:08.315
It's impossible that you
would do something like that.

00:04:08.392 --> 00:04:10.826
There's no way that you
could do something like that.

00:04:12.396 --> 00:04:13.920
You're the type of person...

00:04:13.997 --> 00:04:16.295
...who would dig up a flower by
the root to bring it to me...

00:04:17.000 --> 00:04:19.468
...because you wouldn't
dare break its stem.

00:04:21.004 --> 00:04:22.096
Afterwards, the two of us...

00:04:22.172 --> 00:04:24.936
...replanted the flower together in
a corner of the garden.

00:04:27.344 --> 00:04:30.973
And so, you're not a person
capable of killing anyone.

00:04:39.289 --> 00:04:44.090
I've become crazy. I've thought
about nothing but killing.

00:04:45.128 --> 00:04:48.120
I felt that the only option was to destroy
everything and start from scratch.

00:04:50.500 --> 00:04:54.732
No, I believe in you,
Kokujun! I believe in you!

00:04:55.706 --> 00:05:00.405
You haven't killed anyone. And there
are other ways to start again.

00:05:03.814 --> 00:05:05.782
If you truly believe in starting over...

00:05:07.150 --> 00:05:09.118
...then please become
head of the Sa Clan.

00:05:11.822 --> 00:05:13.881
That's ridiculous.

00:05:13.991 --> 00:05:15.015
How is it ridiculous?!

00:05:15.092 --> 00:05:18.994
You've always given all you can
for the sake of the Sa Clan.

00:05:20.263 --> 00:05:21.992
But in the end,
I could do nothing.

00:05:22.065 --> 00:05:24.727
And now I've done
something I can't undo.

00:05:24.868 --> 00:05:26.836
Please, that's enough!

00:05:27.704 --> 00:05:31.105
To you, the issue is
not who killed him.

00:05:31.808 --> 00:05:35.608
The real regret is not being able
to save him before it came to this.

00:05:36.380 --> 00:05:38.348
Wherever the truth may lie...

00:05:38.782 --> 00:05:41.250
...you'll continue to blame yourself
like this for the rest of your life...

00:05:41.918 --> 00:05:44.386
...telling yourself you
couldn't do anything.

00:05:45.155 --> 00:05:47.282
Even as you bear guilt and
regret on your shoulders...

00:05:47.391 --> 00:05:48.619
...as long as you're alive...

00:05:48.692 --> 00:05:51.024
...there are things that you can
accomplish. And you can start over.

00:05:51.094 --> 00:05:52.527
Am I wrong?

00:05:53.997 --> 00:05:56.522
But if you say that the
burden is too great...

00:05:56.600 --> 00:05:59.068
...and you can't take another step,
then it can't be helped.

00:05:59.603 --> 00:06:02.731
Please remain here. I'll go.

00:06:03.573 --> 00:06:05.541
I will become
head of the Sa Clan...

00:06:06.009 --> 00:06:09.843
...and do what I must to atone for
the crimes committed by the clan.

00:06:14.818 --> 00:06:18.879
This is what I decided to
do when I found this ring.

00:06:22.726 --> 00:06:26.321
The ring of the head of the Sa Clan?
But it was supposedly lost!

00:06:27.564 --> 00:06:28.656
There's no mistake...

00:06:28.732 --> 00:06:31.565
...this is the one that was on
Grandfather Enjun's finger.

00:06:33.970 --> 00:06:38.066
As of this moment, I,
Shunki Sa shall inherit this ring!

00:06:47.884 --> 00:06:49.852
Wait!

00:06:52.756 --> 00:06:58.422
I cannot allow you to atone
for my guilt and regrets.

00:07:06.470 --> 00:07:09.633
Great-Uncle Enjun always
wore this here, didn't he?

00:07:15.779 --> 00:07:17.747
Like you said, I will no doubt...

00:07:17.814 --> 00:07:20.282
...continue to regret what happened
today for the rest of my life.

00:07:20.884 --> 00:07:26.186
If you figure the road I've
taken to this day led me here...

00:07:27.491 --> 00:07:30.551
...regardless of the truth,
in a sense, I did kill him.

00:07:31.595 --> 00:07:33.927
If I had taken another
path sooner...

00:07:36.099 --> 00:07:38.567
...things might not
have ended like this.

00:07:39.970 --> 00:07:41.938
Over... and over...

00:07:43.006 --> 00:07:46.601
I'll repeatedly think back on today.
I'll surely dream about it until I die.

00:07:47.043 --> 00:07:49.011
I must never forget about it.

00:07:49.546 --> 00:07:53.277
But you're telling me that that
alone won't help matters, right?

00:07:57.354 --> 00:08:01.347
Walk the same path your
Great-Uncle Enjun took in the past.

00:08:18.575 --> 00:08:20.668
I've seen that person before.

00:08:21.478 --> 00:08:24.208
Great-Uncle... Enjun?

00:08:25.482 --> 00:08:26.642
Advisor Sa?!

00:08:28.118 --> 00:08:30.279
So in the end it's you that
has come forward, Kokujun.

00:08:31.121 --> 00:08:34.090
It must've been a painful decision for
you, given your youth and kindness.

00:08:35.926 --> 00:08:37.894
If you become the
head of the Sa Clan...

00:08:37.961 --> 00:08:40.486
...you will continue to experience
many painful feelings.

00:08:40.897 --> 00:08:43.559
The kinder you are,
the more you will shed tears.

00:08:44.334 --> 00:08:48.498
But that's all good. Above all, be
sure never to let go of your kindness.

00:08:50.373 --> 00:08:52.432
Do not be a man never
to show emotion.

00:08:53.043 --> 00:08:55.534
Cry whenever your heart is pierced...

00:08:55.612 --> 00:08:57.580
...then stand right back up
and go forth again.

00:08:58.782 --> 00:09:01.250
Do not mistake who you
should be protecting.

00:09:01.585 --> 00:09:03.780
No matter how stained
in blood you become...

00:09:03.853 --> 00:09:06.822
...make sure you never hurt the
ones whom you should protect.

00:09:07.857 --> 00:09:10.087
Become a kind and strong man.

00:09:10.627 --> 00:09:13.858
Shunki will be there for you,
just like Eiki was there for me.

00:09:20.570 --> 00:09:22.538
Grandfather.

00:09:25.141 --> 00:09:27.371
I don't have a single
redeeming quality...

00:09:27.444 --> 00:09:29.605
...and I have never
succeeded at anything.

00:09:31.047 --> 00:09:34.016
But even if it's slowly...

00:09:34.484 --> 00:09:36.952
...I'm capable of following in
Great-Uncle Enjun's footsteps...

00:09:37.887 --> 00:09:39.855
...of putting in the effort.

00:09:42.559 --> 00:09:47.758
It'll be a long, long journey, Shunki.
It will seem close to eternal.

00:09:48.732 --> 00:09:49.596
Yes.

00:09:50.800 --> 00:09:56.397
I am a weak person, so I would be
crushed if I were all by myself. So...!

00:10:00.677 --> 00:10:06.343
I will forever be by your side
and support you, Kokujun.

00:10:10.387 --> 00:10:12.355
Thank you.

00:10:21.598 --> 00:10:25.227
Kokujun Sa. Have you
made your resolution?

00:10:26.036 --> 00:10:29.802
Do you understand the meaning
of the decision you are making?

00:10:30.840 --> 00:10:31.602
Yes.

00:10:35.211 --> 00:10:37.304
I hereby acknowledge
Kokujun Sa's appointment...

00:10:37.380 --> 00:10:38.677
...as head of the Sa Clan.

00:10:39.449 --> 00:10:40.643
I, Shurei Hong...

00:10:40.717 --> 00:10:44.084
...Governor of Sa Province
offer my heartfelt congratulations.

00:10:45.588 --> 00:10:48.989
Regarding this current incident,
after the facts become clear...

00:10:49.292 --> 00:10:51.760
...I will be in touch with
you at a later time...

00:10:51.828 --> 00:10:54.956
...regarding the responsibilities
you are to incur as clan head.

00:10:56.032 --> 00:10:58.159
I shall abide by your decision.

00:11:03.907 --> 00:11:07.240
Father. I will become
head of the Sa Clan.

00:11:08.345 --> 00:11:10.313
I'll spend my life atoning
for their crimes.

00:11:11.114 --> 00:11:13.082
Now, let's go.

00:11:14.517 --> 00:11:17.111
Rest in peace under
the light of the sun.

00:11:24.060 --> 00:11:29.020
The Story of Saiunkoku

00:11:53.823 --> 00:11:55.518
Great-Aunt Eiki.

00:11:55.825 --> 00:11:57.725
That ring! Are you prepared or not...

00:11:57.794 --> 00:12:01.127
...to walk the same path that my
husband has tread?

00:12:02.365 --> 00:12:05.163
I'm prepared! Well,
I have made that decision.

00:12:05.835 --> 00:12:08.599
So, please help me along the
path that I am about to take.

00:12:17.480 --> 00:12:21.883
Well said.
You're an ordinary man.

00:12:22.719 --> 00:12:23.708
Yes.

00:12:23.787 --> 00:12:26.756
But because you know your
weaknesses, you can become strong.

00:12:27.257 --> 00:12:29.555
Because you have no possessions,
you can move forward...

00:12:29.626 --> 00:12:31.617
...without discarding the things
that are truly important to you.

00:12:31.694 --> 00:12:33.719
There is nothing that you lack.

00:12:36.966 --> 00:12:40.766
Well then... What are you waiting for?!
Hurry and get ready!

00:12:41.004 --> 00:12:41.971
Get ready?

00:12:42.572 --> 00:12:43.561
You dummy!

00:12:44.641 --> 00:12:46.905
Today's the selection ceremony
for the head of the Sa Clan!

00:12:46.976 --> 00:12:48.568
Hurry up and get changed!

00:12:48.711 --> 00:12:49.643
R-Right!

00:12:51.948 --> 00:12:53.848
He's so undependable.

00:12:55.819 --> 00:12:57.787
Grandmother.

00:12:59.322 --> 00:13:02.450
This must be Advisor
Sa's wife, Eiki Hyo.

00:13:06.796 --> 00:13:09.196
I offer you my most
sincere apologies...

00:13:09.799 --> 00:13:12.267
...for all the trouble that
the Sa Clan has caused you.

00:13:12.402 --> 00:13:16.202
Still, can I ask that you stay
with us for just a little longer?

00:13:17.073 --> 00:13:19.507
Why, of course I'll stay.
That was my intent.

00:13:20.710 --> 00:13:23.645
Thank you very much.
By the way, Shunki...

00:13:24.214 --> 00:13:27.012
...are you sure you won't have
any regrets choosing that man?

00:13:27.650 --> 00:13:31.279
I believe that I will become at
least as happy as you, Grandmother.

00:13:32.388 --> 00:13:34.356
As happy as me, you say?

00:13:36.526 --> 00:13:40.018
Well, I doubt it, but I challenge
you to make the effort.

00:13:40.430 --> 00:13:40.896
Yes.

00:13:57.447 --> 00:14:00.041
So that kid's the governor
of Sa Province.

00:14:00.283 --> 00:14:02.513
He doesn't look like
he's good for anything.

00:14:02.585 --> 00:14:04.553
In fact, that works in our favor.

00:14:04.754 --> 00:14:07.848
He's likely to do exactly as we,
the Sa Clan, demand of him.

00:14:08.358 --> 00:14:10.326
Don't worry about it.

00:14:10.393 --> 00:14:13.294
As expected, neither Sakujun
nor Kokujun are here.

00:14:13.663 --> 00:14:14.687
Right.

00:14:26.809 --> 00:14:29.107
Come to think of it
Enjun Sa killed...

00:14:29.178 --> 00:14:32.409
...all the heirs from the main branch of
the clan in a gathering just like this.

00:14:32.882 --> 00:14:35.851
He had become a fool and mistakenly
thought he had the trust of the king.

00:14:36.052 --> 00:14:38.520
But Chusho, that bastard.
How arrogant of him...

00:14:38.588 --> 00:14:41.921
...to summon us all here as
if he were the clan head!

00:14:42.258 --> 00:14:44.522
There's no need to
wait for Chusho.

00:14:44.827 --> 00:14:47.921
Let's raise our glasses for a
celebratory toast ourselves.

00:14:48.197 --> 00:14:50.165
- Good idea.
- Let's do that.

00:14:50.533 --> 00:14:52.296
This building is strangely built

00:14:52.368 --> 00:14:54.836
The walls are thin,
and there are only a few pillars.

00:14:59.776 --> 00:15:02.745
- Lieutenant Governor Ro!
- Stop, Sho!

00:15:04.213 --> 00:15:06.181
Don't come in any further
no matter what.

00:15:07.483 --> 00:15:10.577
- It's slanted to one side.
- Don't tell me old man Chusho...

00:15:11.988 --> 00:15:14.479
I hate to give orders
to such beautiful girls...

00:15:15.091 --> 00:15:17.355
...but please make your way
out of here one at a time.

00:15:17.427 --> 00:15:20.419
Otherwise, this building will
collapse, flatten everything...

00:15:20.496 --> 00:15:22.464
...and we'll all die together.

00:15:23.933 --> 00:15:25.901
You see, the roof is
slanted to one side.

00:15:26.102 --> 00:15:29.469
And there are way too few pillars
for support. See what I'm saying?

00:15:30.039 --> 00:15:32.906
Not to mention that the floor is thin and
the centre of gravity is off to one side.

00:15:33.509 --> 00:15:35.136
This place is purposely
built so that...

00:15:35.211 --> 00:15:37.111
...one step or movement could
bring the entire thing down.

00:15:37.180 --> 00:15:41.116
- Damn that Chusho!
- He's trying to wipe us all out at once!

00:15:41.384 --> 00:15:43.045
Show your face!

00:15:43.119 --> 00:15:45.587
Sho. Have you had a talk
with Chusho?

00:15:45.922 --> 00:15:47.048
Yes.

00:15:47.123 --> 00:15:49.091
So how's the old man?

00:15:50.460 --> 00:15:53.190
I believe he has
passed away by now.

00:15:53.997 --> 00:15:56.830
- What did you say?
- What do you mean by that?

00:15:57.967 --> 00:16:00.834
Oh, the timing's perfect.
Way to go, Yushun.

00:16:08.678 --> 00:16:09.975
At this time...

00:16:10.046 --> 00:16:12.412
...evidence of numerous improprieties
committed by the Sa Clan...

00:16:13.216 --> 00:16:15.776
...has been submitted by the mayors
of the districts of Sa Province.

00:16:16.319 --> 00:16:18.412
After deliberation on
what has been received...

00:16:18.488 --> 00:16:20.479
...the court has determined that
there is more than adequate proof...

00:16:20.556 --> 00:16:22.217
...to place you under arrest.

00:16:22.291 --> 00:16:23.485
Today, as of this moment...

00:16:23.559 --> 00:16:25.891
...we are conducting a full
investigation of the Sa Clan.

00:16:25.962 --> 00:16:28.192
Wh-What are you saying, brat?
You think that you're so important?!

00:16:28.264 --> 00:16:30.698
Remember your position and where
you are, you insignificant one!

00:16:30.767 --> 00:16:33.235
How dare you insult one of
the proud Seven Colored Clans!

00:16:33.636 --> 00:16:35.661
I am the Co-Governor of Sa Province.

00:16:36.572 --> 00:16:39.700
As a provincial governor, I will
make a fair and proper judgment.

00:16:40.176 --> 00:16:42.144
And judgment will not be overruled.

00:16:43.146 --> 00:16:45.774
The Sa Clan's head representative will
have an opportunity to talk with me.

00:16:46.449 --> 00:16:50.977
Of course, that person will bear the
greatest responsibility and guilt.

00:16:52.455 --> 00:16:54.013
Fortunately, today is the
day of the selection...

00:16:54.090 --> 00:16:55.250
...and the appointment ceremony.

00:16:55.758 --> 00:16:57.020
So please make your
selection and decide...

00:16:57.093 --> 00:16:59.323
...who shall become
the head of the clan.

00:17:03.566 --> 00:17:06.467
Well, the process involved
in deciding on a clan head...

00:17:06.536 --> 00:17:09.505
...for one of the Seven Colored
Clans is a serious matter.

00:17:10.640 --> 00:17:15.043
Could you please give us
until at least, say, tomorrow?

00:17:18.014 --> 00:17:20.983
You pathetic old men just don't
know when to give up, do you?!

00:17:21.751 --> 00:17:24.549
Wait until tomorrow morning?
There's no need to wait!

00:17:26.889 --> 00:17:28.857
I will inherit the position.

00:17:29.959 --> 00:17:32.553
Wearing this ring, the legitimate
mark of the head of the Sa Clan...

00:17:33.029 --> 00:17:34.587
...from this day forward I,
Kokujun Sa...

00:17:34.664 --> 00:17:37.531
...shall take my place
as head of the clan.

00:17:38.234 --> 00:17:40.225
So you had it all along, Eiki Hyo!

00:17:40.403 --> 00:17:41.927
No, it must be a fake!

00:17:42.205 --> 00:17:45.663
Shut up! This is real!
Stop your complaining!

00:17:46.309 --> 00:17:49.278
From now on, I shall be
Kokujun Sa's advisor.

00:17:49.946 --> 00:17:52.414
Anything that this boy lacks due
to his youth, I will make up for.

00:17:53.316 --> 00:17:55.807
Now, you old men is there
anyone among you...

00:17:55.885 --> 00:17:58.820
...with the guts to step
forward as head of the clan?

00:18:01.491 --> 00:18:03.425
I hereby acknowledge
Kokujun Sa's appointment...

00:18:03.493 --> 00:18:05.120
...as head of the Sa Clan...

00:18:06.295 --> 00:18:09.093
...and as Governor of Sa Province
offer my heartfelt congratulations.

00:18:09.966 --> 00:18:11.797
Thank you.

00:18:13.202 --> 00:18:17.730
So they've finally arrived.
Arrest them! But very gently!

00:18:18.975 --> 00:18:22.911
Don't try to resist. One false
move and you'll be flattened.

00:18:26.716 --> 00:18:28.684
That man isn't here.

00:18:29.118 --> 00:18:31.086
We'll be separated
for a while, Shunki.

00:18:31.521 --> 00:18:32.613
As leader of the clan...

00:18:32.688 --> 00:18:35.350
...I must take responsibility
and share their confinement.

00:18:36.526 --> 00:18:38.790
No, I'll be at your side.

00:18:41.664 --> 00:18:44.224
Um... I may be late
in mentioning this...

00:18:45.401 --> 00:18:48.928
...but you have a beautiful voice.
I'm glad I could hear it.

00:19:03.286 --> 00:19:05.083
Enjun!

00:19:05.154 --> 00:19:07.486
It's over, Sho.
You've come just in time.

00:19:08.324 --> 00:19:11.555
I didn't bring you here
for something like this.

00:19:12.662 --> 00:19:17.258
I just wanted to show you the man
who would inherit your intentions...

00:19:18.034 --> 00:19:21.003
...and the beginning of a new era
so you can finally rest in peace.

00:19:21.804 --> 00:19:23.772
It's the last matter
I wanted to settle.

00:19:24.040 --> 00:19:27.476
I prefer to rest only after I've
been able to help the best I can.

00:19:28.077 --> 00:19:29.408
Enjun.

00:19:29.912 --> 00:19:31.846
There's one thing I want to
make clear to you.

00:19:31.914 --> 00:19:33.381
Kokujun hasn't killed anyone.

00:19:33.983 --> 00:19:38.818
I know. I know. So, don't
worry about anything now.

00:19:39.589 --> 00:19:42.752
You may have died, but you haven't
been cured of your stupidity.

00:19:43.459 --> 00:19:45.450
You never went to see Eiki.

00:19:45.528 --> 00:19:48.861
Well, whose stupidity is it not to
allow a dead man to rest in peace?

00:19:49.632 --> 00:19:53.261
You never change.
Right to the very last moment.

00:19:55.137 --> 00:19:57.105
Goodbye, Sho.

00:19:57.473 --> 00:19:59.065
Enjun!

00:20:02.178 --> 00:20:04.942
Rest in peace, Enjun.
Sweet dreams.

00:20:13.022 --> 00:20:14.990
Wow, you're pretty skilled at that.

00:20:15.191 --> 00:20:17.659
I never expected to
receive such a compliment...

00:20:18.594 --> 00:20:21.586
...from a former prince with so much
talent in the finer arts.

00:20:22.298 --> 00:20:24.630
But I don't remember
inviting you here.

00:20:27.637 --> 00:20:29.605
What can I help you with?

00:20:32.074 --> 00:20:34.042
I thought I'd make you drink this.

00:20:35.011 --> 00:20:36.979
My, oh my.

00:20:37.813 --> 00:20:42.273
But instead of doing that, why not
kill me quickly, with that sword.

00:20:43.152 --> 00:20:44.176
I'd love to do that...

00:20:44.287 --> 00:20:46.312
...but it's important that you
receive some sort of judgment.

00:20:46.923 --> 00:20:50.256
However, no matter how secure
a prison you're thrown into...

00:20:51.193 --> 00:20:53.991
...keeping your mental capability
intact would be too risky.

00:20:55.031 --> 00:21:00.162
You don't have very good taste,
trying to make me a living puppet.

00:21:01.070 --> 00:21:03.038
I'm fighting poison with poison.

00:21:04.840 --> 00:21:07.434
How do you intend to
make me drink that?

00:21:08.144 --> 00:21:10.544
I considered beating you
until you became unconscious...

00:21:10.613 --> 00:21:13.138
...and then forcing it
down your throat.

00:21:14.016 --> 00:21:16.541
But that would take way
too much time.

00:21:17.687 --> 00:21:19.279
So I gave up on
that idea. Besides...

00:21:19.355 --> 00:21:21.516
...I thought I'd like to
have a talk with you.

00:21:23.893 --> 00:21:24.860
Let's play a little game.

00:21:24.927 --> 00:21:27.452
We'll bet something we
each want from the other.

00:21:28.431 --> 00:21:32.458
Something I want from you?
Do you have the thing that I desire?

00:21:33.636 --> 00:21:35.968
Are you telling me that
she belongs to you?

00:21:36.172 --> 00:21:40.836
No. But as long as I exist she'll
never fall into your possession.

00:21:41.143 --> 00:21:46.740
You're a hindrance, indeed.
I want her to see only me.

00:21:47.883 --> 00:21:52.183
So, what you want is for me
to become a puppet. I see.

00:21:52.388 --> 00:21:55.152
That's a fair trade.
All right, you're on.

00:21:58.861 --> 00:22:01.591
I had the poison that you brought
poured into one of these cups.

00:22:01.998 --> 00:22:04.523
Of course, not even I know
which one it's been poured into.

00:22:04.834 --> 00:22:06.631
By the way,
how immediate is the effect?

00:22:07.036 --> 00:22:10.267
You body will start going limp in
about the time it takes to boil water.

00:22:11.073 --> 00:22:14.474
Well then, why don't we
drink up while we're talking?

00:22:15.244 --> 00:22:17.872
Oh, aside from the
poison you brought...

00:22:17.947 --> 00:22:21.348
...there should be lethal poison
in about five other cups.

00:22:21.917 --> 00:22:25.011
The effect should appear in more
or less the same amount of time.

00:22:26.989 --> 00:22:31.483
You're very thorough.
Do you do this sort of thing often?

00:22:32.361 --> 00:22:36.695
Excitement in life is important.
Especially for people like me.

00:22:37.933 --> 00:22:40.197
Where's the fun without a
little something like this?

00:22:40.503 --> 00:22:43.233
I'd like you to write this
down for me somewhere.

00:22:44.073 --> 00:22:46.633
That "I've grown pessimistic of my
pathetic life, so I'm gonna die."

00:22:47.076 --> 00:22:50.273
In that case could you write...

00:22:50.379 --> 00:22:53.746
..."Sorry, I've carelessly
swallowed poison"?

00:22:57.453 --> 00:23:01.412
Then, as a show of
hospitality I'll go first.

00:23:04.360 --> 00:23:06.328
Five-three.

00:23:17.873 --> 00:23:19.841
Your turn.

00:23:30.553 --> 00:23:35.650
Itsumo sugoku jiyu na anata ha ima

00:23:35.858 --> 00:23:42.195
Kono ame no naka donna
Yume wo oikaketeiruno

00:23:42.498 --> 00:23:47.458
Dokokade kodoku to tatakainagara

00:23:47.670 --> 00:23:52.767
Namida mo gaman shiterundarou

00:23:53.776 --> 00:23:58.179
Hitori demo daijobu to

00:23:59.715 --> 00:24:04.846
Anata mo watashi to onaji

00:24:05.621 --> 00:24:16.190
Tomawari bakari dakedo
Nazeka kono michi ga suki de

00:24:17.066 --> 00:24:22.663
Shiawase da toka ureshii toki ha

00:24:23.072 --> 00:24:28.135
Anata no koto wo omoidasu kara

00:24:29.011 --> 00:24:34.574
Iroazayaka na kisetsu ha kitto

00:24:34.950 --> 00:24:41.753
Kono omoi todoketekureru

00:24:45.094 --> 00:24:45.761
Next Episode

00:24:45.761 --> 00:24:47.363
Next Episode
Kokujun has been selected...

00:24:47.363 --> 00:24:47.396
Next Episode

00:24:47.396 --> 00:24:49.498
Next Episode
Every Meeting Ends in Parting
...as the new head of the Sa Clan.

00:24:49.498 --> 00:24:49.532
Next Episode
Every Meeting Ends in Parting

00:24:49.532 --> 00:24:51.667
Next Episode
Every Meeting Ends in Parting
Things will be hectic from now on...

00:24:51.667 --> 00:24:51.700
Next Episode
Every Meeting Ends in Parting

00:24:51.700 --> 00:24:54.100
Next Episode
Every Meeting Ends in Parting
...but if he works with Shunki to
overcome his difficulties, he'll be fine.

00:24:54.170 --> 00:24:57.469
Huh? I don't see Seiran or that man.
